@format 1
@id queue.clear-all
@title Clear all non-running work
@area Queue
@entry input
@summary Confirm and remove all clearable durable work while preserving work that cannot safely be cleared.
@flow TB
@related queue.clear-done, queue.cancel-work

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Clear All requested <input>
- Receive the Clear All command @ console.PConsoleAllHandle(...)
> confirm

[confirm] Confirm removal <decision>
- Apply the destructive-action confirmation preference @ console.PConsoleDestructiveConfirm(...)
? "Removal is declined" > unchanged
? "Removal proceeds" > clear

[clear] Remove clearable records <storage>
- Clear durable schedule folders and repair stale state @ schedule.LScheduleAllClear(...)
> result

[result] Clearable work removed <output>
= The schedule retains only work not eligible for the clear operation.

[unchanged] Schedule unchanged <output>
= No record is removed.
